{"id":3616,"slug":"3616-content-projection-voi-ng-content-dung-khi-nao","category":"Angular","subcategory":"Components & Templates","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Content projection với `ng-content` dùng khi nào?","question_en":"When should you use content projection with `ng-content`?","answer_vi":"`ng-content` cho phép parent truyền markup vào layout của child component, tương tự slot.\n\nVí dụ card có slot tiêu đề và nội dung:\n```html\n<header><ng-content select=\"[card-title]\" /></header>\n<section><ng-content /></section>\n```\n```html\n<app-card>\n  <h2 card-title>Profile</h2>\n  <app-profile />\n</app-card>\n```\nDùng khi xây component wrapper như card, modal, tabs, layout shell, nơi child quyết định khung còn parent quyết định nội dung. Tránh API slot quá phức tạp nếu component chỉ cần vài input đơn giản.","answer_en":"`ng-content` lets a parent pass markup into a child component layout, similar to slots.\n\nExample card with title and body slots:\n```html\n<header><ng-content select=\"[card-title]\" /></header>\n<section><ng-content /></section>\n```\n```html\n<app-card>\n  <h2 card-title>Profile</h2>\n  <app-profile />\n</app-card>\n```\nUse it for wrapper components such as cards, modals, tabs or layout shells, where the child controls the frame and the parent controls the content. Avoid overly complex slot APIs when a component only needs a few simple inputs.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>ng-content</code> cho phép parent truyền markup vào layout của child component, tương tự slot.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Ví dụ card có slot tiêu đề và nội dung:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;header&gt;&lt;ng-content select=&quot;[card-title]&quot; /&gt;&lt;/header&gt;\n&lt;section&gt;&lt;ng-content /&gt;&lt;/section&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ng-content</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">select</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;[card-title]&quot;</span> /&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ng-content</span> /&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;app-card&gt;\n  &lt;h2 card-title&gt;Profile&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;app-profile /&gt;\n&lt;/app-card&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">app-card</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">card-title</span>&gt;</span>Profile<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">app-profile</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">app-card</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng khi xây component wrapper như card, modal, tabs, layout shell, nơi child quyết định khung còn parent quyết định nội dung.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Tránh API slot quá phức tạp nếu component chỉ cần vài input đơn giản.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>ng-content</code> lets a parent pass markup into a child component layout, similar to slots.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Example card with title and body slots:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;header&gt;&lt;ng-content select=&quot;[card-title]&quot; /&gt;&lt;/header&gt;\n&lt;section&gt;&lt;ng-content /&gt;&lt;/section&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"1