code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">app-card</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">card-title</span>&gt;</span>Profile<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">app-profile</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">app-card</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Use it for wrapper components such as cards, modals, tabs or layout shells, where the child controls the frame and the parent controls the content.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Avoid overly complex slot APIs when a component only needs a few simple inputs.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3605-lifecycle-hooks-trong-angular-chay-theo-thu-tu-nao-va-dung-khi-nao","title":"Lifecycle hooks trong Angular chạy theo thứ tự nào và dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/3607-interpolation-property-binding-va-event-binding-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"Interpolation, property binding và event binding khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3608-two-way-binding-ngmodel-hoat-dong-the-nao","title":"Two-way binding `[(ngModel)]` hoạt động thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3609-input-va-output-trong-angular-component-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Input và Output trong Angular component dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/3610-signal-input-input-khac-input-truyen-thong-the-nao","title":"Signal input `input()` khác `@Input()` truyền thống thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3611-model-input-model-dung-khi-nao","title":"Model input `model()` dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/3612-directive-trong-angular-la-gi-structural-directive-khac-attribute-directive-the","title":"Directive trong Angular là gì? Structural directive khác attribute directive thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3613-control-flow-moi-if-for-switch-khac-ngif-ngfor-the-nao","title":"Control flow mới `@if`, `@for`, `@switch` khác `*ngIf`, `*ngFor` thế nào?"}]}